import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Affiliate Disclosure — NEXA" description="How affiliate links work on NEXA: manual links only, no invented prices or ratings, and how commissions work.">
  <div class="mx-auto prose-nexa" style="max-width:820px;padding:2.5rem 1rem 0">
    <h1 class="font-display" style="font-size:2.4rem;font-weight:900;color:var(--ink)">Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
    <p><em>Last updated: November 10, 2026.</em></p>
    <h2>The short version</h2>
    <p>Some links on NEXA — mainly on product and review pages — may be affiliate links. If you click one and buy something, the seller may pay NEXA a commission. It costs you nothing extra.</p>
    <h2>How we do it</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Affiliate links are added <strong>manually by our editors</strong> to individual products, never injected automatically across the site.</li>
      <li>Affiliate links use <code>rel="sponsored nofollow noopener"</code> and product pages carry an FTC disclosure notice.</li>
      <li>We only write editorial reviews of products and tools connected to our real workflow.</li>
      <li><strong>Prices are never invented.</strong> A price appears only when an editor has entered a verified one; otherwise the page says "Check price" and links to the official or store page.</li>
      <li><strong>Ratings are editorial.</strong> If a rating appears, it is labelled "Editorial rating" — our editors' opinion, not a collected user rating, and never a fabricated review count.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Advertising disclosure</h2>
    <p>Advertising networks (such as Google AdSense or Adsterra) are <strong>not active</strong> on this site at this time. The site contains reserved, empty ad slots in its code for a possible future activation by the site owner. If ads are ever enabled, they will be visually labelled "Advertisement", this page and the <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a> will be updated, and a cookie-consent choice will be offered before ad scripts load.</p>
    <h2>Questions</h2>
    <p>Ask us anything about a specific link via the <a href="/contact/">Contact page</a> — include the page URL.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
